DESCRIPTION:You will attend the meeting in your group of four at Huxley Lab
  219C\, and the meeting will last for approximately 15 minutes.\n\nIf anyo
 ne is unable to attend the in-person meeting at this time\, please discuss
  this with your teammates and let me know a new time slot that works best 
 for everyone in your group.\nIf your entire group would prefer an online m
 eeting\, as we had last week\, please ask one person to email me and copy 
 in all other group members. I will then aim to make alternative arrangemen
 ts with your group.\nPlease note that attendance at the group meeting will
  be recorded and will contribute to your assessment.\n
