BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:This is the Teams meeting link for your final presentation in H
 XLY145. You will present in person\, and your marker\, Terry (qw4017)\, wi
 ll join online via this Teams meeting.\nThis link covers Groups 45\, 46\, 
 47\, and 48. The presentation schedule is as follows:\nGroup 45: 09:00–0
 9:30\nGroup 46: 09:30–10:00\nGroup 47: 10:00–10:30\nGroup 48: 10:30–
 11:00\nAt the start of your presentation\, please ask one group member to 
 join the Teams meeting from the machine in HXLY145\, so that I can access 
 the room video and audio.\nI would recommend sending a copy of your presen
 tation slides to your email beforehand\, so that the slides can be accesse
 d from the HXLY145 machine.\nPlease also make sure to bring your laptop an
 d phone\, as we may ask you to use them for certain demonstrations during 
 the meeting. For example:\n\n  *   If your slides cannot be accessed from 
 the HXLY145 machine\, you can share your screen from your laptop.\n  *   Y
 ou may use your laptop to show your code repository\, IDE\, etc.\n  *   Yo
 u may use your phone camera to show the blinking LED.\n  *   If the audio 
 in HXLY145 is not working\, you may use the microphone on your phone to ma
 ke sure you can be heard.\n\nAfter the meeting\, please leave your RPi kit
  at the designated location in HXLY145.\nI sincerely apologise for the hyb
 rid format of the final presentation. Please let me know if you have any q
 uestions.\nI wish you all a successful final presentation.\n\n\n__________
