 ng-you/services-for-students/\nEvent id: 5426409\nNotes: **Handling Confli
 ct and Assertiveness**\nGroup projects require collaboration and the abili
 ty to address potential disagreements quickly and respectfully. The same i
 s true of any work environment\, and with internship applications open now
